the BS, UE and RIS and compute the BS–RIS, RIS–UE and BS–UE channel matrices Q, hk
and gk . We then initialize the baseband digital beamformer wkBB , the RF analog beamformer

F RF , the RF-chain switch matrix C RF , the active RIS power-amplification matrix ΛRIS , the
phase-shift matrix ϕRIS , the passive RIS element-switch matrix B RIS and the active RIS
element-switch matrix ARIS , and treat these initial parameters as the initial state [s0 ] handed

to the trained CDRL for subsequent inference. The CDRL algorithm we proposed is shown
